  "outcome": "A closed M\u00f6bius formula extends three compatible pair transports, signed 2x2x2 cubes preserve every pair marginal, and lexicographically triangular cube reduction terminates. Every one of 512 outcome-blind p199 structural faces repairs exactly, but every one of the 314 faces with an initial forbidden defect has a literal nonjoinable reached critical diamond. Deterministic construction survives; literal confluence is refuted on every nontrivial frozen start.",
  "questioning_correction": {
    "exact_reason": "If a pivot violates the 01 diagonal, changing only coordinate 2 leaves a second cube vertex with the same forbidden 01 pair; a zero-marginal cube cannot isolate that defect.",
    "implication": "A new engine must contract coupled forbidden fibers or use their relative homology, not independent defect deletion.",
    "rejected_idea": "Remove each forbidden coefficient with one cube having seven allowed companion vertices."
  },
